{"type":"META","ticket":48503,"id":"META"}||{"title":"CA-IS2062A","tags":["信号隔离器件","隔离式CAN收发器(带电源)"],"source":"f0c935430d56463499dcfd5a80ea6af5|0819f05c4eef4c71ace90d822a990e87","images":["https://alimg.szlcsc.com/upload/public/product/middle/20250109/6FFC91F6254A615834FD4E8EBB48D59E.jpg"],"attributes":{"LCSC Part Name":"内置DC-DC转换器的2.5kVRMs隔离式CAN收发器","Supplier Part":"C22438481","Manufacturer":"Chipanalog(川土微)","Manufacturer Part":"CA-IS2062A","Supplier Footprint":"LGA-16(4.7x5.2)","JLCPCB Part Class":"Extended Part","Datasheet":"https://item.szlcsc.com/datasheet/CA-IS2062A/24076703.html","Supplier":"LCSC","Add into BOM":"yes","Convert to PCB":"yes","Symbol":"ba2d0b8049402eca","Designator":"U?","Footprint":"38189732fbe3e6fa","3D Model":"6b3b241c64ef48319bd306b964f86535|0819f05c4eef4c71ace90d822a990e87","3D Model Title":"LGA-16_L5.2-W4.7-P0.65-TL_CA-IS2062A-FRANK2","3D Model Transform":"185.11774,204.724,0,0,0,0,0,0,0","Data Rate(Max)":"5Mbps","Isolation Voltage(Vrms)":"2500","CMTI(kV/us)":"150kV/us","Operating Temperature":"-40℃~+125℃","Features":"CAN FD；总线故障检测与保护","Name":"={Manufacturer Part}","Description":"CA-IS2062A 是一款隔离式控制器局域网（CAN）收发器，内部集成DC-DC 转换器，省去了外部隔离电源，有效节省系统空间和简化设计。该器件提供较高的电气隔离等级并具有优异的性能，可以满足工业应用的需求。器件内部的逻辑输入与输出缓冲器之间通过二氧化硅（SiO₂）绝缘栅隔离，能够承受高达2.5kV_RMS（1 分钟）的隔离电压以及±150kV/μs 的典型共模瞬态抗扰度。","SymbolName":"{\"name\":\"CA-IS2062A\",\"uuid\":\"ba2d0b8049402eca\",\"source\":\"\"}","FootprintName":"{\"name\":\"LGA-16_L5.2-W4.7-P0.65-TL_CA-IS2062A-FRANK2\",\"uuid\":\"38189732fbe3e6fa\",\"source\":\"\"}"}}|
